      "long_eel":     { "night": 2.5 },
      "golden_koi":   { "clear": 1.8, "day": 1.5 }
    }
  },

  "rival": {
    "_comment": "THE RIVAL ANGLER (DECISIONS #169), for worlds the module runs (no sidecar): he stands at stand (x, ground y, z) on the level named, facing yaw_deg (0 faces -Z), and fishes the spots listed while a round plays, through the same rolls as a player, and appears in the standings. His fights are not played: one lasts fight_s_per_kg_sqrt x the square root of the catch's weight (within fight_s), and lands with land_chance by the catch's rarity (index 0 to 4). rest_s is his pause between casts. tests/test_runner.gd (lakeside) checks the stand is on the ground and the spots in his rod's reach.",
